# Expected colour-transition sequence for the 'non-git' prompt state.
#
# Outside a repo: one segment, then the closing arrow.
#
# THIS FILE IS THE SPEC. Nothing re-derives it at test time. To change how
# the prompt looks, edit this file and starship.toml in the same commit.
#
# Provenance: derived once from zsh/agnoster.zsh-theme at f663cdc.
# Format: fg=<0-7|None> bg=<0-7|None> <python-repr of the visible text>
fg=0 bg=4 ' /tmp '
fg=4 bg=None ''
